{"id":"n16301-4-10","stage":2,"title":"걸치다 · 担","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16301-4-10-1","ko":"앉을 자리가 없네.","zh":"没地方坐了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앉을","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉을","audio":"/audio/cb7f342c95be3075f14f.mp3"}},{"text":"자리가","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리가","audio":"/audio/9fc2a6b98e2660dff494.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"不在","explanation":"없다：不在；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人、事物、现象等不占据某处或空间。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6a5c0c06010d9f77cc9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16301-4-10-2","ko":"계단에 엉덩이라도 살짝 걸치고 있어.","zh":"至少把屁股搭在楼梯上吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"계단에","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계단에","audio":"/audio/6930534fb14797c6dc83.mp3"}},{"text":"엉덩이라도","meaning":"屁股，臀部","explanation":"엉덩이：屁股，臀部；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"엉덩이","audio":"/audio/25d6d1ae86b669fab14a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15128","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉덩이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엉덩이라도","audio":"/audio/6b1b9a6db7f8a9394df2.mp3"}},{"text":"살짝","meaning":"稍微","explanation":"살짝：稍微","readings":[{"term":"살짝","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61612","senseId":"3","lemma":"살짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살짝","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3"}},{"text":"걸치고","meaning":"搭着、搁在上面（坐在台阶上）","explanation":"걸치다：搭着、搁在上面（坐在台阶上）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"걸치다","audio":"/audio/0d6f90903c248486b6a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16301","senseId":"4","lemma":"걸치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸치고","audio":"/audio/f9a070e24c67bdc56745.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"25d6d1ae86b669fa","term":"엉덩이","zh":"屁股，臀部","audio":"/audio/25d6d1ae86b669fab14a.mp3","entryId":"15128","definition":"指连接腰部与大腿的盆骨部分后方的浑圆部位。当坐下来时，其部位接触地面。","pronunciation":["엉ː덩이"]},{"id":"cf17ce5604310bf9","term":"살짝","zh":"稍微","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3","entryI